<https://w3id.org/spot/am> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An extension to the Space Types Ontology (SPOT) for the explicit definition of axes and boundary point mappings between Entity Spaces and their reference spaces (Entity, Document or Asset Space)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SPOT Axis Mapping Ontology"@en .
