<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasAccuracy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/spot/am#AxisMapping> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasAccuracy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/spot/am#Accuracy> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasAccuracy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies the accuracy level of an axis mapping."@en .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasAccuracy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has accuracy"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasAxisMapping
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasAxisMapping> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasAxisMapping> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/spot#Appearance> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasAxisMapping> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/spot/am#AxisMapping> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasAxisMapping> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates an appearance to an axis mapping object. One appearance can have multiple Axis Mappings. Typically three: For each Entity Axis one."@en .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasAxisMapping> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has axis mapping"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasAxisRelationType
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasAxisRelationType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasAxisRelationType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/spot/am#AxisMapping> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasAxisRelationType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/spot/am#AxisRelationType> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasAxisRelationType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies which kind of geometrical relation the two mapped axes have to each other."@en .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasAxisRelationType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has axis relation type"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasBoundaryPoint
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasBoundaryPoint> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasBoundaryPoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/spot#Axis> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasBoundaryPoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/spot/am#BoundaryPoint> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasBoundaryPoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates an axis to a boundary point. These points can than be mapped/related to a reference space.\r\n        Usually, only Axes of Entity Spaces get Boundary Point Definitions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasBoundaryPoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has boundary point"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasBoundaryPointMapping
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasBoundaryPointMapping> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasBoundaryPointMapping> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/spot#Appearance> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasBoundaryPointMapping> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/spot/am#BoundaryPointMapping> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasBoundaryPointMapping> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates an appearance to a boundary point mapping. Each appearance can have multiple boundary point mappings.\r\n     For mappings of volume spaces, up to 6 boundary points mappings are usually needed (min and max point of each axis)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasBoundaryPointMapping> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has boundary point mapping"@en .
# 
